  <hr class="gold-rule">

  <p>I build websites and publications. My main project is <a href="https://thefreethinkingtimes.com">The Freethinking Times</a>, an independent publication I've run since 2022. Project Broadsheet grew out of what I built to run it, and I released it because other people kept asking me how it worked.</p>

  <p>By day I run <a href="https://www.pikespeakwebdesigns.com">Pikes Peak Web Designs</a>, a small web-design practice focused on fast, accessible sites that last. Every project is done by me personally — no outsourcing, no contractors.</p>

  <p>If you'd like to talk about a publication or a website, <a href="/contact/">write to me</a> or <a href="/book-a-call/">set up a call</a>.</p>

